  "caveats": [
    "Site contrast is observational; cannot assert why UM males live longer.",
    "The full study reports sex-by-site and mass-survival effects already; no novelty claim.",
    "Treatment=1 pools nominally noneffective drugs, not a specific randomized agent.",
    "No event/censor flag in derived phenotype file. Truncated lifespan statistic is not Kaplan-Meier or hazard.",
    "Birth cohorts 2010-2013 not jointly represented at all three sites and are excluded.",
    "Mouse sex code verified against author's Figure1.R but prose counts in Nature 2026 appear reversed; needs author confirmation.",
    "Selection bias after 183-day weight measurement; no mediation or causal claim.",
    "Independence by cage and litter not established. All CIs exploratory."
  ]
